     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Inviting",
     "texto": [
      "**İster misin?** = do you want to?; **birlikte** = together; **tabii** = of course.",
      "The pattern **-maya/-meye ne dersin?** suggests an activity: **sinemaya gitmeye ne dersin?** = how about going to the cinema?",
      "A polite reply can begin with **Memnuniyetle** («with pleasure») or **Üzgünüm** («I'm sorry»)."
     ],
